; Keeps `include "transactions/*.beancount"` in main.beancount resolvable
; before the first `bookkeeper sync` has generated a dated file here (glob
; includes error if nothing matches, and Python's glob skips dotfiles, so
; this file deliberately does NOT start with a dot). Contains zero
; directives. Safe to leave in place once real files land alongside it
; (bookkeeper.ingest owns this directory) — remove only if a dated file's
; glob match makes it redundant.
